And they're like,
"Ohh, were we bad?"

00:09:45.718 --> 00:09:48.087 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:09:48.087 --> 00:09:51.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
So now we got to keep an eye
on these guys.

00:09:51.791 --> 00:09:54.594 line:92%
Like, "Ohh, did we mess up?"

00:09:54.594 --> 00:09:59.198 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.198 --> 00:10:00.733 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckles ]

00:10:00.733 --> 00:10:04.337
We used to do this thing
when we had everyone here

00:10:04.337 --> 00:10:05.271 line:92%
called five-dollar Fridays

00:10:05.271 --> 00:10:08.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
which was we all wrote our nam
on a five-dollar bill,

00:10:08.608 --> 00:10:11.944
we'd put it in one of thos
spinny lottery ball things -

00:10:11.944 --> 00:10:15.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
if there's a word,
do let me know -- and...

00:10:15.481 --> 00:10:16.248 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:10:16.248 --> 00:10:18.384
And we talked about it 'cause we
had Henry Winkler on this week

00:10:18.384 --> 00:10:21.253
and when Henry Winkler was
back here in normal times,

00:10:21.253 --> 00:10:24.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
he saw this, and the great
Henry Winkler said,

00:10:24.056 --> 00:10:25.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, can I play?"
And we said, "Sure."

00:10:25.825 --> 00:10:27.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so he wrote his name on it
and sure enough,

00:10:27.493 --> 00:10:29.695 size:88% position:44%
of, you know, whatever,
the 50, 60 five-dollars,

00:10:29.695 --> 00:10:32.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
Henry Winkler wins, which mean
he gets all the money.

00:10:32.264 --> 00:10:36.168
But Henry Winkler's a great guy,
so he bought us all pizza.

00:10:36.168 --> 00:10:37.169 line:92%
Anyway, he's here this week.

00:10:37.169 --> 00:10:39.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
We bring out the old machine
the thingy,

00:10:39.071 --> 00:10:41.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we put Henry Winkler's
five dollars in,

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:42.675 line:92%
and we decide to do it again

00:10:42.675 --> 00:10:47.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Christine Arbulu,
our script supervisor, wins.

00:10:47.513 --> 00:10:49.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I make a crack
that, you know,

00:10:49.649 --> 00:10:52.885
this isn't gonna be a situatio
where we're all gonna get pizza,

00:10:52.885 --> 00:10:53.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause Christine
would never do that.

00:10:53.953 --> 00:10:57.723
Anyway, this is, like, mor
an apology than a correction

00:10:57.723 --> 00:10:58.491 line:92%
'cause sure enough, today,

00:10:58.491 --> 00:11:00.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
Christine got cookies
for everybody.

00:11:00.926 --> 00:11:02.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just wanted to make sure
that's clear,

00:11:02.762 --> 00:11:05.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, you know, I also want
to point out

00:11:05.164 --> 00:11:07.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
that that might not
have happened

00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:09.735 line:92%
if I hadn't publicly shamed her.

00:11:09.735 --> 00:11:13.272 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:11:13.272 --> 00:11:16.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, you know, while everybod
is thanking Christine,

00:11:16.776 --> 00:11:19.345 line:92%
I think that, you know...

00:11:19.345 --> 00:11:23.949
You know, on behalf of everyone,
thank you, Christine,

00:11:23.949 --> 00:11:26.052 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
but also...

00:11:26.052 --> 00:11:27.787 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you're welcome.

00:11:27.787 --> 00:11:30.122 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:11:30.122 --> 00:11:33.926 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Um...last thing.

00:11:33.926 --> 00:11:36.395 line:92%
We had a little -- an ID.

00:11:36.395 --> 00:11:39.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mocked up an ID because it i
20 years in the building.

00:11:39.565 --> 00:11:41.200 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And a couple things --

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
One, so, it was a picture of m
as a kid, and I held it up

00:11:43.769 --> 00:11:46.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we took a close-up,
and a bunch of people said

00:11:46.038 --> 00:11:49.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Uh, it said NBCUniversal
on that,

00:11:49.008 --> 00:11:51.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that merger hadn't happene
in 2001."

00:11:51.744 --> 00:11:53.412 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I'm like, okay.

00:11:53.412 --> 00:11:54.814 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Did not realize

00:11:54.814 --> 00:11:57.149
you guys cared so much
about that kind of thing.

00:11:57.149 --> 00:11:58.117 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckles ]

00:11:58.117 --> 00:11:59.985 line:92%
But the real feedback was,

00:11:59.985 --> 00:12:03.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of you said,
"Dude, you need a manicure

00:12:03.122 --> 00:12:05.357 line:92%
Your fingers are disgusting.

00:12:05.357 --> 00:12:06.592 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughing ] Geez!

00:12:06.592 --> 00:12:07.226 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-For real.

00:12:07.226 --> 00:12:09.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
I talked about the prop budget
and people were like,

00:12:09.795 --> 00:12:10.896 line:92%
"You need a manicure budget.

00:12:10.896 --> 00:12:14.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's true--
I do chew my nails.

00:12:14.266 --> 00:12:16.135 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I didn't always.

00:12:16.135 --> 00:12:18.204 line:92%
I think I started around..

00:12:18.204 --> 00:12:20.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
the first time
we did "Corrections."

00:12:20.906 --> 00:12:23.309 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:12:23.309 --> 00:12:25.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, 'cause I used to
you know --

00:12:25.578 --> 00:12:29.915
I used to feel good about myself
and what I did.

00:12:29.915 --> 00:12:31.050 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And you remember --

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first time
Shoemaker walked in,

00:12:32.451 --> 00:12:35.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, the night I was doin
the first "Corrections."

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was working on it
in my office and he comes in

00:12:36.789 --> 00:12:40.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
he's like, "Oh! What's wit
the bloody hangnails?!"

00:12:40.392 --> 00:12:41.060 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:42.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I was really
working on 'em.

00:12:42.128 --> 00:12:43.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "I don't know
what to tell you, Shoemaker.

00:12:43.829 --> 00:12:45.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said Legos
instead of Lego bricks

00:12:45.531 --> 00:12:49.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the whole [bleep] world'
coming down on me!"

00:12:49.101 --> 00:12:51.437 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:12:51.437 --> 00:12:52.872 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But I do...

00:12:52.872 --> 00:12:56.142
I do want to use this Olympi
hiatus that we're about to go on

00:12:56.142 --> 00:12:59.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
to improve my situation,
so I'm gonna try

00:12:59.411 --> 00:13:01.447 size:88% position:44% line:92%
to stop biting my nails.

00:13:01.447 --> 00:13:02.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know,
maybe in a couple weeks,

00:13:02.681 --> 00:13:05.084
we'll take a close-up again,
maybe I'll feel, you know,

00:13:05.084 --> 00:13:07.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
confident enough
to show you where we're at

00:13:07.853 --> 00:13:09.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think it's important
you know,

00:13:09.255 --> 00:13:12.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I think, you know,
if this ends

00:13:12.892 --> 00:13:16.428 line:92%
with me holding that Emmy...

00:13:16.428 --> 00:13:17.797 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:13:17.797 --> 00:13:20.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
...I want to have
beautiful hands.

00:13:22.868 --> 00:13:30.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think that's about everythin
this week.

00:13:30.109 --> 00:13:33.145 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Do enjoy our time away,

00:13:33.145 --> 00:13:37.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we'll see you
after the Olympics.

